      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Asbestos Testing and Removal in Lara and Corio</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Corio and Norlane were built in bulk through the 1950s and 60s, which is exactly the period when asbestos cement sheeting was standard. Get it tested before you touch it, and we will put you in touch with a licensed removalist for a quote.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
